{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o034a","title":"张松劝刘璋迎刘备拒曹","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o034a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘璋闻曹操欲使钟繇等讨张鲁而惧，张松劝其迎刘备讨张鲁以御曹。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o034a-q"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-63cac5793b7a5ebd8a20","label":"正文","text":"张松复说璋引刘备自固","evidence":["liuermu-q-dde36aaadb127cf1c44d","liuermu-q2-5b650d5ea983b66bb39d"]},{"id":"huangli-a-11e1c891c11047777d08","label":"正文","text":"张松建议迎刘备伐张鲁","evidence":["huangli-q-7b14f5ca8eb72424010d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"议策","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o034a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0045","role":"进说","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o034a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0279","role":"建议所伐者","evidence":["huangli-q-7b14f5ca8eb72424010d"]}],"place":{"text":"益州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o034a-q"]},"time":{"year":211,"label":"建安十六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y211","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o034","basis":"建安十六年"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o034a-q","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,141,"O034a"],"order":6467}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0253","name":"刘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0279","name":"张鲁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0045","name":"张松","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-7b14f5ca8eb72424010d","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-4bdc6c78c5ae5bde5231","layer":"original","quote":"时别驾张松建议，宜迎先主，使伐张鲁","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-dde36aaadb127cf1c44d","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bb8534db9135eea0c435","layer":"original","quote":"后松复说璋曰：“今州中诸将庞羲、李异等，皆恃功骄豪，欲有外意〖15〗；不得豫州〖16〗，则敌攻其外，民攻其内：必败之道也","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q2-5b650d5ea983b66bb39d","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bb8534db9135eea0c435","layer":"original","quote":"后松复说璋曰：“今州中诸将庞羲、李异等，皆恃功骄豪，欲有外意〖15〗；不得豫州〖16〗，则敌攻其外，民攻其内：必败之道也。”璋又从之，遣法正请先主。璋主簿黄权陈其利害〖17〗，从事广汉王累自倒悬于州门以谏〖18〗；璋一无所纳，敕在所：供奉先主〖19〗；先主入境如归〖20〗。","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o034a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/T